[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0155","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0155.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0176","title":"Serv-U FTP 服务器路径泄漏漏洞","description":"Serv-U FTP 服务器 2.5d 及之前版本的默认配置存在路径泄漏漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向服务器请求不存在的目录或文件 URL，利用默认错误响应获取服务器真实文件系统路径。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需认证即可触发，泄漏的路径信息可辅助攻击者进一步探测目录结构、定位敏感文件，为后续攻击提供信息支撑，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0176"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-29T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:09.550","remediation":"升级 Serv-U 至 2.5e 或更高版本以修复路径泄漏缺陷；若无法升级，在 Serv-U 配置中将默认错误提示信息修改为固定通用提示（如 \"File not found\"），避免返回真实路径；同时在 FTP 根目录限制用户访问权限，避免 web 目录与系统目录交叉。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-02/0417.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1016","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0176.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0176","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0176.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6962d12e25fbf447fb7ec00c59de25f9ba4e2a94/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0176.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8585-x3v3-r54f/GHSA-8585-x3v3-r54f.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/ftp_servu_path_disclosure.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0176.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--957ae3ce-6f58-4592-a5fb-3d6d37e65665.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0155.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0179","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0179.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0203","title":"Trend Micro OfficeScan 3.5 tmlisten.exe 远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Trend Micro OfficeScan 3.5 的 tmlisten.exe 组件存在输入验证缺陷，远程攻击者可通过向 12345 端口发送特制的畸形数据包，触发该组件异常崩溃，导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 OfficeScan 3.5 版本，攻击者无需认证即可远程利用，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0203"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-28T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:12.990","remediation":"立即安装 Trend Micro 官方提供的 OfficeScan 3.5 补丁（下载地址 http://www.antivirus.com/download/ofce_patch_35.htm）。建议升级到不再使用 tmlisten.exe 的受支持版本（如 Apex One）。若无法立即升级，在防火墙上阻断外部对 TCP 端口 12345 的访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.antivirus.com/download/ofce_patch_35.htm","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1013","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=412FC0AFD62ED31191B40008C7E9A11A0D481D%40srvnt04.previnet.it","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=D129BBE1730AD2118A0300805FC1C2FE038AF28B%40209-76-212-10.trendmicro.com","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/40c65e734a16e244433aafd42706edabef09072d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0203.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0203","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0203.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/99462b1672511a2817705398570cd388f155e617/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0203.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8pmq-57jj-jpjv/GHSA-8pmq-57jj-jpjv.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/T/tmosdos.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0203.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--486180f9-84d2-40e9-b774-101fb9b46a1a.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001201.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0179.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0173","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0173.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0196","title":"GNU nmh mhshow 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Linux nmh 邮件处理套件中的 mhshow 组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送包含恶意构造 MIME 头的电子邮件触发该漏洞，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 nmh 0.27 及更早版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。建议用户升级至 nmh 1.0 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0196"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2000-02-28T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:12.113","remediation":"升级 nmh 软件包至 1.0 及以上版本。Red Hat Linux 用户应参照 RHSA-2000-006 安全公告安装修补后的 nmh 程序包；其他发行版用户应更新至 nmh 1.0 或更高版本。临时缓解措施可禁用 mhshow 对 MIME 头的自动解析处理。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-006.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1018","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fbc52696b7594c66d398b40fcc0dc269121d7362/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0196.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0196","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0196.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6af0515548db3ee9e7e86d58b079762631fa8897/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0196.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vj6m-3fq9-gmmh/GHSA-vj6m-3fq9-gmmh.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--27dadb6b-f642-4cda-9bad-3a0961b2508f.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001200.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0196.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0173.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0164","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0164.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0186","title":"Linux ext2fs backup dump 缓冲区溢出权限提升漏洞","description":"Linux ext2fs 备份套件中的 dump 工具存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向 dump 命令传递超长命令行参数触发缓冲区溢出，从而获取目标系统的 root 权限。该漏洞影响 Mandrake Linux 等发行版本，危害等级高，攻击者需拥有本地访问权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0186"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2000-02-28T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:10.780","remediation":"立即升级到 Linux 内核 2.4.2+ 并安装 e2fsprogs 4.1 或更高版本，此版本修复了 dump 工具的缓冲区溢出漏洞，并通过编译时堆栈保护机制直接防止相关攻击。卸载多余的 suid 版本的 dump 二进制文件，禁止意外运行 suid/sgid 权限的工具，使用安全的 ext2fs 实用程序替代。为了进一步加强系统安全性，可以通过 iptables 的默认拒绝策略实现额外的缓冲区溢出缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-100.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1020","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bf570d3b8e47bf0003b46684217cf02c76e2c7f4/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0186.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0186","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0186.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6af0515548db3ee9e7e86d58b079762631fa8897/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0186.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9wvw-vvv2-7x37/GHSA-9wvw-vvv2-7x37.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0186.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--5564f0f4-a287-4668-9f66-9b79598d4b7f.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001199.txt","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0164.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0157","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0157.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0179","title":"HP OpenView OmniBack 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"HP OpenView OmniBack II 2.55/3.0/3.1 存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标端口 5555 发送大量连接请求，触发服务资源耗尽导致崩溃。该漏洞影响 HP OpenView OmniBack II 2.55、3.0 及 3.1 版本，攻击条件简单，可造成备份服务中断，影响企业备份系统的可用性，需及时升级修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0179"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-28T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:09.917","remediation":"建议在防火墙层面限制对 TCP 5555 端口的访问，仅允许受信任的管理网段连接。由于 HP OpenView OmniBack 已停止维护多年，官方补丁渠道早已关闭，应尽快迁移至受支持的备份解决方案以彻底消除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-02/0387.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1015","http://www1.itrc.hp.com/service/cki/docDisplay.do?docId=HPSBUX0006-115","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19782","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0179.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0179","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0179.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6962d12e25fbf447fb7ec00c59de25f9ba4e2a94/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0179.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gmvx-gg98-qqwq/GHSA-gmvx-gg98-qqwq.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0179.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001198.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--c1026c7b-c5ef-4ab6-9b78-4c2cde57382f.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/80642f827c3cd89c2fb8893d0e3fe04ead516ea4/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0157.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0157.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0157.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0156","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0156.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0178","title":"Foundry Networks ServerIron 交换机可预测 TCP 序列号漏洞","description":"Foundry Networks 公司生产的 ServerIron 系列交换机存在 TCP/IP 序列号可预测漏洞。由于设备生成的 TCP 初始序列号缺乏足够随机性，远程攻击者可预测并伪造 TCP 连接数据包，实现会话劫持或欺骗攻击。该漏洞影响 ServerIron 系列交换机，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者无需认证即可通过网络远程利用，可能导致网络流量被拦截、篡改或敏感信息泄露。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0178"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-28T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:09.800","remediation":"建议升级 ServerIron 交换机固件至启用了 RFC 1948 随机初始序列号(ISN)生成算法的最新版本。由于 Foundry Networks 已被 Brocade 收购（后并入 Broadcom），请登录 Broadcom/Brocade 支持门户检查对应型号是否有安全固件更新。如设备已停止维护无法升级，可在边界防火墙上启用 TCP 序列号随机化功能（如 Cisco ASA 的 tcp-randomize-sequence-number），或部署 IPS 设备对 TCP 会话进行完整性校验，并严格限制网络设备管理接口仅允许可信管理网段访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.foundrynet.com/bugTraq.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1017","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0178.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0178","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0178.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6962d12e25fbf447fb7ec00c59de25f9ba4e2a94/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0178.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xwch-qpr5-vp62/GHSA-xwch-qpr5-vp62.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0178.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--850699b2-b4a4-44b3-855a-67222684f5a8.owl","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-2000.jsonl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0156.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0180","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0180.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0204","title":"Trend Micro OfficeScan 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Trend Micro OfficeScan Corporate Edition 3.0/3.5/3.11/3.13 版本的客户端存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者无需认证即可向目标系统的 12345 端口建立 5 个 HTTP 连接，导致 CPU 利用率升至 100%，造成服务不可用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0204"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-02-28","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"Trend Micro 已发布针对 OfficeScan 3.5 的补丁程序（ofce_patch_35.htm），建议升级至修复版本。若无法升级，应在网络边界防火墙中限制端口 12345 仅允许受信 IP 访问，或禁用 OfficeScan 客户端的远程管理监听功能，防止外部攻击者利用此漏洞耗尽 CPU 资源。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-02/0340.html","http://www.antivirus.com/download/ofce_patch_35.htm","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1013","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=D129BBE1730AD2118A0300805FC1C2FE038AF28B%40209-76-212-10.trendmicro.com"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0180.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0606","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0606.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0187","title":"Alex Heiphetz Group eZshopper loadpage.cgi 目录遍历与远程命令执行漏洞","description":"EZShopper 3.0 的 loadpage.cgi CGI 脚本存在目录遍历和远程命令执行漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 loadpage.cgi 传入包含 `..` 序列的路径参数遍历服务器目录，读取任意文件；或通过注入 shell 元字符执行系统命令。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证，可导致敏感信息泄露和服务器被完全控制，影响 EZShopper 3.0 版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0187"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-27T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:10.903","remediation":"立即停止使用 EZShopper 3.0，将该软件从服务器彻底卸载或下线，因其已停止维护且无法获取安全更新。如暂无法下线，请在 Web 服务器（Apache/Nginx）层面配置访问控制规则，禁止外部访问 loadpage.cgi 脚本，并删除或重命名该文件以阻断利用路径。同时检查服务器是否存在 webshell 等后门文件，必要时重建服务器。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-02/0356.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1014","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19781","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0187.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0187","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0187.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6962d12e25fbf447fb7ec00c59de25f9ba4e2a94/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0187.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-j9g5-5989-hfr7/GHSA-j9g5-5989-hfr7.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0187.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1014/info.html","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001194.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0606.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0606.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0606.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0165","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0165.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0188","title":"EZShopper search.cgi 任意文件读取和远程命令执行漏洞","description":"EZShopper 3.0 的 search.cgi CGI 脚本存在路径遍历及命令注入漏洞，远程未经认证的攻击者可利用 ..（点点）目录遍历技术读取服务器上任意文件，或通过构造含 shell 元字符的恶意请求执行系统命令。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，攻击复杂度低，影响 EZShopper 3.0 版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0188"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-27T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:11.027","remediation":"立即升级 EZShopper 至最新版本或应用厂商提供的安全补丁。如无法升级，请从服务器移除或重命名 search.cgi 脚本，或通过 Web 服务器配置（如 Apache 的 mod_rewrite 或 .htaccess）限制对该脚本的访问，仅允许授信 IP 段请求。同时确保 Web 服务器以低权限用户运行，禁用 CGI 目录的执行权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-02/0356.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1014","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0188.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0188","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0188.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f85df5a91c5446a7fcdf9094db67818508b32b7c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0188.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-r7fv-g54q-h3xf/GHSA-r7fv-g54q-h3xf.json","https://github.com/NetBSD/pkgsrc-wip/blob/1e259307452fa6083f86403d8e77caee7006ff5d/sara/PLIST","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/iisprotect_sql_injection.nasl","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/E/ezshopper.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0165.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0184","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0184.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0209","title":"Lynx 缓冲区溢出代码执行漏洞","description":"Lynx 2.x 版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过在恶意网页中构造超长 URL 链接，诱使 Lynx 用户访问后触发栈缓冲区溢出，导致浏览器程序崩溃，甚至可能以当前用户权限执行任意代码。该漏洞利用无需认证，但需要用户交互（点击恶意链接），影响 Lynx 2.x 全系列版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0209"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-02-27","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"升级 Lynx 至官方修复版本，该版本已修复 URL 长度校验不严导致的缓冲区溢出问题。如无法立即升级，可限制用户仅访问受信任站点，或使用 w3m 等替代浏览器作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1012"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0184.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0149","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0149.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0170","title":"Linux man 本地缓冲区溢出权限提升漏洞","description":"Linux 系统中的 man 帮助程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过设置超长的 MANPAGER 环境变量触发该漏洞，导致以 man 组权限（egid 15）执行任意代码，实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响 RedHat 6.1 等 Linux 发行版，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。利用方式为本地触发，无需目标系统开启网络服务。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0170"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-26T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:08.797","remediation":"升级 RedHat 6.1 的 man 程序包至修复版本（如 man-1.5i-4），或直接升级至受支持的 RedHat Enterprise Linux 现代版本（RHEL 7/8/9）。如无法升级系统，可临时移除 man 命令的 SGID 权限（chmod g-s /usr/bin/man），并在 /etc/profile 中全局禁止通过 MANPAGER 环境变量传递恶意参数，同时限制不可信用户的本地 shell 访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1011","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/255","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0170.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/75714a8ac899a2d78a02cc77946dc01b2cac6c38/2000/CVE-2000-0170.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/dc4a87067238e8e55e5d3f9777b54558310f6d6e/2000/CVE-2000-0170/paper.txt","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0170","https://github.com/ycdxsb/PocOrExp_in_Github/blob/9c403f53c634b5fba65371b2388288bf1d7f551e/2000/README.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b8e6f3ed799539d1c038cf82ae94c10d35c39858/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0170.json","https://github.com/diannaofengzi/POC/blob/14d504f7488db9229f6f02be54aab53e3cfee0dc/databases/2000/database/CVE-2000-0170/README.md","https://github.com/0xT11/CVE-POC/blob/2b6f11c3712c0efb88ac3edeab3d0aafa1f7a090/2000/CVE-2000-0170.json","https://github.com/CVEhive/CVEhive/blob/b9915233fd01050601434cf4b7a2b0f95536073b/data/CVE-2022-31813/repo/2000/CVE-2000-0170/paper.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/mike182/exploit"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0149.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0149.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0149.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0196","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0196.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0221","title":"Nortel Nautica Marlin SNMP 服务 UDP 数据包拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Nortel Nautica Marlin 桥接设备的 SNMP 服务存在拒绝服务漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标设备 SNMP 端口（UDP 161）发送零长度 UDP 数据包，触发 SNMP 服务进程崩溃，导致设备拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Nortel Nautica Marlin 系列桥接设备，攻击复杂度低，无需认证即可远程利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0221"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-25T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:15.397","remediation":"升级 Nortel Nautica Marlin 设备固件至最新版本；如无法升级，可在设备 ACL 中限制 SNMP 端口 (UDP 161) 仅允许信任源 IP 访问，或在边界防火墙上过滤发往该端口的零长度 UDP 数据包。如业务不需要 SNMP 管理，建议直接关闭 SNMP 服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1009","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19766","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/837e8232e5e0f859088f714711fc711909aefe8c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0221.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0221","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0221.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9c3559b25784ca21f930998243369aaa64d45e45/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0221.json","https://github.com/eldondev/Snort/blob/34bdcf6a7a638b55c7c04f77ef1efa526ad08e33/doc/signatures/279.txt","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/dos.rules","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0221.json","https://github.com/slacker247/GPDA/blob/fa9006d0877a691f1ddffe88799c844a3e8a669a/Sodi/Run/IDSrules/rule.190","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0196.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0195","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0195.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0220","title":"Zone Labs ZoneAlarm 敏感信息明文传输漏洞","description":"ZoneAlarm 防火墙在处理用户请求事件详细信息时，会以明文方式将系统配置、网络拓扑等敏感信息发送至 Zone Labs 服务器，中间人攻击者可通过网络嗅探拦截并获取这些未加密数据。该漏洞影响 ZoneAlarm 早期版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危，建议用户升级至修复版本并避免在不可信网络中使用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0220"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-24T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:15.270","remediation":"升级 ZoneAlarm 至最新版本，新版本已对用户请求事件详情时的数据传输进行加密处理。如无法立即升级，可在 ZoneAlarm 设置中关闭\"事件详情在线查询\"功能，或通过防火墙规则阻止 ZoneAlarm 进程向 Zone Labs 服务器（zones.zonelabs.com）发送明文 HTTP 请求，改用加密通道传输敏感系统与网络信息。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0220","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/837e8232e5e0f859088f714711fc711909aefe8c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0220.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0220","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/e6a2c88657ae90cd7ad32328e40c3e9d3c5f5451/2000/CVE-2000-0220.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0220.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xc4x-697w-hrmr/GHSA-xc4x-697w-hrmr.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9c3559b25784ca21f930998243369aaa64d45e45/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0220.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88311/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/4741b68d7df3ee95f92711bd26337adccd49bef2/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0195.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0192","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0192.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0217","title":"OpenSSH X11 转发会话劫持漏洞","description":"SSH 客户端默认配置启用了 X11 转发功能，当用户使用 SSH 连接到攻击者控制的恶意服务器时，服务器端可通过恶意的 xauth 程序劫持客户端的 X11 会话，进而捕获键盘输入、窃取屏幕内容或执行任意 X 窗口操作。攻击条件简单，仅需诱导受害者连接至恶意 SSH 服务器即可触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0217"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-24T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:14.860","remediation":"修改 SSH 客户端配置文件 `~/.ssh/config` 或系统级 `/etc/ssh/ssh_config`，将 `ForwardX11` 设为 `no` 以禁用 X11 转发；同时升级 OpenSSH 到 4.0 以上版本（该版本默认已关闭 X11 转发），并确保 `xauth` 程序位于可信路径且权限为 755。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1006","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/837e8232e5e0f859088f714711fc711909aefe8c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0217.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0217","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0217.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9c3559b25784ca21f930998243369aaa64d45e45/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0217.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6hfg-9p4g-2q8c/GHSA-6hfg-9p4g-2q8c.json","https://github.com/djc/oxish/blob/bf64cf02d5e31a17e708d69e2e0f66422499f851/openssh-vulnerabilities.md","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/O/openssh_123.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001190.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0192.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0189","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0189.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0214","title":"FTPx FTP Explorer 弱密码加密漏洞","description":"FTPx FTP Explorer 1.0.00.10 版本存在弱密码加密漏洞。该软件在存储 FTP 站点的用户名、密码及配置文件时使用了弱加密算法，本地攻击者可访问存储的配置文件，通过分析弱加密数据还原出明文密码，进而获取目标 FTP 服务器的访问权限。该漏洞影响 FTPx FTP Explorer 1.0.00.10 版本，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。攻击者需具备对受影响系统的本地访问权限方可利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0214"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-24T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:14.457","remediation":"立即停止使用 FTP Explorer 1.0.00.10，其加密算法过于简单（使用 XOR 或类似弱算法），存储的 FTP 密码可被轻易逆向还原。建议迁移至支持强加密存储的 FTP 客户端，如 FileZilla（免费开源，支持主密码加密凭据库）或 WinSCP（支持 AES 加密存储站点凭据）。如暂时无法更换客户端，切勿在软件中保存任何 FTP 密码，改为每次手动输入，并在操作系统层面限制该程序所在目录的访问权限（仅允许 Administrators 组读取）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1003","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=Pine.LNX.4.10.10002242035500.30645-100000%40unreal.sekure.org","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19762","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f410e8277949e9113269176595e70bd0c0230a55/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0214.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0214","https://github.com/nbrito/research/blob/f070ce78f917d962de8df74cc7a841f1cbbcfa00/cve/CVE-2000-0214/main.c","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0214.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9c3559b25784ca21f930998243369aaa64d45e45/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0214.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-c5m3-8qfv-wr54/GHSA-c5m3-8qfv-wr54.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1003/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0214.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0189.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0189.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0189.toml"}]